          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2">
            <heading>Navigation Act 2012</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1">
              <num>5</num>
              <heading>Subsection 14(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>regulations</i></b> (except in subsections 331(2), 339(1), 341(2), 342(1) and 343(1) and any other provision where the context indicates otherwise) includes Marine Orders made under subsection 342(1).</p>
                  <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                  <p><i>House of Representatives on 20 September 2018</i></p>
                  <p><i>Senate on 18 October 2018</i>]</p>
                  <p>(203/18)</p>
                </content>
